ri\": \"viking://user/default/memories/preferences/user/vue computed与prop命名规范.md\",\n44 |       \"cooldown_note\": \"never_checked\",\n45 |       \"frontmatter\": {},\n46 |       \"body_sha256_16\": \"909e7f208bd23b37\",\n47 |       \"content\": \"- Vue 组件中 computed 属性不可与 prop 同名，否则触发 Vue warn，须重命名\\\\n- OperationBtnGroup 内 businessName 为 prop，新增 effectivePermissionPrefix 计算属性及 permissionPrefix 等 props，按钮 :permission 改用 effectivePermissionPrefix，接口提交仍传 businessName prop\"\n48 |     },\n49 |     {\n50 |       \"uri\": \"viking://user/default/memories/entities/小程序技术/scss_wxss_leak.md\",\n51 |       \"cooldown_note\": \"never_checked\",\n52 |       \"frontmatter\": {},\n53 |       \"body_sha256_16\": \"be491bc979c23313\",\n54 |       \"content\": \"# 主包scss组件注入uni.scss致上传超限\\\\n苏住房C小程序因未加scoped的scss组件把整份uni.scss注入组件wxss，导致主包上传预估超2048KB。\\\\n\\\\n## 问题现象\\\\n- 构建在 size:main 校验失败，主包磁盘1766.6KB未超2048KB，上传预估1766.6×1.17≈2066.9KB超限额约19KB\\\\n- 33个scss组件每个wxss多约7.5KB重复样式，累计约246KB，ZsButton为压垮临界线的最后一根稻草\\\\n\\\\n## 根因\\\\n- 新增ZsButton用`<style lang=\\\\\"scss\\\\\">`且未scoped，uni-app把整份uni.scss（含@import的zs-button.scss）注入组件wxss，与app.wxss重复\\\\n- 仅看磁盘体积会误判为未超限，实际应按上传预估口径\\\\n\\\\n## 解决方案\\\\n- 新增组件一律写`<style scoped>`且纯CSS，不用scss变量语法，从源头避免注入全局样式\\\\n- 存量项目加 scripts/prune-component-wxss-leak.mjs，构建后裁剪主包components/与uni-icons里泄漏的uni.scss块，接在validate-dist之前\\\\n- 校验收敛到 scripts/size-main-package.mjs 的上传预估口径（×1.17），勿用磁盘体积\\\\n- 修复后主包磁盘1515.5KB、上传预估1773.1KB，余量约275KB，样式仍由app.wxss提供\\\\n\\\\n## 验证与归属\\\\n- 会话 fbb1fcdd 用户贴构建失败 terminals/8.txt:159-176；结论主包磁盘未超、上传预估超约19KB\\\\n- 涉及文件：zhi2-mobile-shimin/src/components/ZsButton/ZsButton.vue、src/styles/zs-button.scss、scripts/size-main-package.mjs、scripts/prune-component-wxss-leak.mjs、scripts/merge-main-leaks.mjs、scripts/relocate-uni-icons.mjs、package.json\\\\n- 所属项目：苏住房C；来源会话ID：fbb1fcdd-721a-4559-b7a4-6771d348fd61；代码基线：4d6dba9\"\n55 |     },\n56 |     {\n57 |       \"uri\": \"viking://user/default/memories/entities/技术模式/attachment_thumb_pdf.md\",\n58 |       \"cooldown_note\": \"never_checked\",\n59 |       \"frontmatter\": {},\n60 |       \"body_sha256_16\": \"0b9ea76e132442f6\",\n[Notice: 60 items displayed; complete=false; TruncatedBy: worker-limit; nextOffset=61; omitted=263; matched=323; failed=0.]\n\n(Omitted 3381 bytes. Full formatted result stored at: C:\\Users\\ADMINI~1\\AppData\\Local\\Temp\\dsh-spill-PrMk3N\\session-1c77427dafb6\\8863f57d2940-ops_inspect_local_file.txt. Use read with offset/limit, or grep this path to search within it.)", "tool_output_group_id": "msg_b709d9a01b0a44bdbfa185108474e2eb", "tool_output_group_original_chars": 5932, "tool_output_group_budget_chars": 100000}], "created_at": "2026-11-26T10:04:51.950Z", "peer_id": "github.com-tyvt-skills"}
