{"id": "msg_1506aee516174f108b8c436a1288617a", "role": "user", "parts": [{"type": "tool", "tool_id": "chatcmpl-tool-b60d9bae9871821b", "tool_name": "ops_inspect_local_file", "tool_uri": "", "skill_uri": "", "tool_status": "completed", "tool_output": "[cwd: resolvedFrom=D:\\repository\\skills; cwdSource=workingDirectory.]\n=== FILE: C:\\Users\\Administrator\\.dsh\\cache\\memory-audit\\select.json (Lines 61-200 of 323) ===\n[Notice: revision=699fbee8742b515067dde4424eb21505f95848d608b2b14246bf29ba505693fa; bytes=60161.]\n61 |       \"content\": \"# 证书弹窗与附件缩略图显示修复\\\\n苏州市房地产监测V3 项目修复证书查看弹窗空白过大问题，并实现附件按类型显示缩略图（PDF 用固定占位图）。\\\\n\\\\n## 证书弹窗\\\\n- 查看不再固定 `92vh`，弹窗随内容增高\\\\n- 施工证编辑仍用 `92vh`，内部可滚动\\\\n- 查看态内容过长时保留 `max-height` + 滚动，避免被裁切\\\\n\\\\n## 附件缩略图\\\\n- 新增 `src/utils/detailAttachmentDisplay.js`：图片用原图地址；PDF 等用固定图 `/assets/images/file/1.png`\\\\n- `detail-template.vue`：证书 `type: 'image'` 字段，PDF 改为 100×100 缩略图，点击在新窗口打开 PDF\\\\n- `ParcelDialog.vue` 等同步调整\\\\n\\\\n## 验证与归属\\\\n- 验证证据：extracted source=cursor project=苏州市房地产监测V3\\\\n- 所属项目：苏州市房地产监测V3\\\\n- 来源会话ID：f8b24da1-fc8e-489b-974f-b2fbccebc6a9\"\n62 |     },\n63 |     {\n64 |       \"uri\": \"viking://user/default/memories/entities/技术模式/elementplus_size_mini.md\",\n65 |       \"cooldown_note\": \"never_checked\",\n66 |       \"frontmatter\": {},\n67 |       \"body_sha256_16\": \"06e1c1df7fdd55df\",\n68 |       \"content\": \"# Element Plus size 不支持 mini 致全局告警\\\\nElement Plus `size` 仅接受空/default/small/large，项目全局及 `el-select` 使用 Vue2 的 `\\\\\"mini\\\\\"` 触发 Invalid prop 告警。\\\\n## 问题根因\\\\n- Element Plus 的 size prop 合法值为空/default/small/large，不支持 Vue2 时代的 `\\\\\"mini\\\\\"`。\\\\n- 项目全局配置及 `el-select` 组件传入 `\\\\\"mini\\\\\"` 触发 Invalid prop 警告。\\\\n## 解决方案\\\\n- `src/main.js` 与 `src/views/index.vue` 中 `size` 改为 `\\\\\"small\\\\\"` 消除告警。\\\\n## 验证与归属\\\\n- 验证证据：extracted source=cursor session=3b324ddb-991b-4cfd-8477-ff3457de3576\\\\n- 涉及文件：src/main.js、src/views/index.vue；代码基线：none\"\n69 |     },\n70 |     {\n71 |       \"uri\": \"viking://user/default/memories/entities/git_quirk/submodule_worktree_bug.md\",\n72 |       \"cooldown_note\": \"never_checked\",\n73 |       \"frontmatter\": {},\n74 |       \"body_sha256_16\": \"04143ae632e3f0e4\",\n75 |       \"content\": \"# Submodule Worktree Resolution Bug\\\\nGit submodule worktree resolution fails on Windows with nested Chinese paths, returning wrong gitdir.\\\\n\\\\n## Description\\\\n- Submodule `.git` file contains correct UTF-8, but `git -C $wtSub` fails to resolve.\\\\n- `git -C $wtSub` returns the main submodule's gitdir as `--show-toplevel`, so git treats `$wtSub` as the main repo and reports mass deletions.\\\\n- This is a broken-internal-pointer artifact from a pre-existing Windows + nested-Chinese-path quirk in submodule worktree resolution.\\\\n\\\\n## Impact\\\\n- Does not affect the deliverable: parent gitlink (`ls-tree` confirmed `d71a36607`) and submodule HEAD (via explicit gitdir) are both correct.\\\\n- Fix commits are already correct; only a cosmetic `modified content` flag remains.\\\\n\\\\n## Mitigation\\\\n- Inspect worktree internal back-pointer (`gitdir`/`commondir`) and how the superproject views the submodule.\\\\n- Attempt `git worktree repair` to settle the cosmetic `modified conten\n\n[...]\n\n80 构建日志磁盘1790.9KB/2048KB、上传预估2095.4KB/2048KB；修复后 MAIN 磁盘1744.4KB ok、上传预估2040.9KB ok、[validate-dist] ok\\\\n- 涉及文件：zhi2-mobile-shimin/src/utils/mainStaticPaths.js、scripts/prune-main-static.mjs、scripts/size-main-package.mjs、src/utils/index.js\\\\n- 所属项目：苏住房C；来源会话ID：60972d80-2ade-40e7-a35c-5daa665ecffd；代码基线：b7bf813\"\n181 |     },\n182 |     {\n183 |       \"uri\": \"viking://user/default/memories/entities/技术模式/derived_field_watch.md\",\n184 |       \"cooldown_note\": \"never_checked\",\n185 |       \"frontmatter\": {},\n186 |       \"body_sha256_16\": \"9d8cbcc197c3582c\",\n187 |       \"content\": \"# 派生汇总字段必须用 watch 而非 @change\\\\n苏房G 物业管理区域编辑页中由子字段相加得出的只读派生字段（如总建筑面积），挂 @change 会因复制粘贴/程序化赋值不触发而存脏数据。\\\\n\\\\n## 问题根因\\\\n- 原实现把重算挂在子字段 `@change` 上，@change 语义是「用户交互引发的值变化」\\\\n- 鼠标右键粘贴、拖拽填充、上游回填、程序化赋值只改 model 不派发 change，监听不触发\\\\n- 总建筑面积又是只读展示/参与保存字段，于是静默存成脏数据\\\\n\\\\n## 解决方案\\\\n- 改用 `watch` 监听 `form.aboveFloorArea` 与 `form.underFloorArea`（可带 `immediate: true` 保证详情回填后立刻算一遍）\\\\n- `handleChangeFloorArea` 只留纯计算体、不再绑模板 change 事件\\\\n- 三处同构页面一次改齐：`property/complex/detail.vue`（编辑）、`property/complexChange/detail.vue`（变更）、`building/complexSearch/detail.vue`（查询）\\\\n- 先 grep 同名方法：`complexBuildingAuth/detail.vue` 有同名 handleChangeFloorArea 但模板无对应面积输入框，属死代码勿改\\\\n\\\\n## 验证与归属\\\\n- 验证证据：extracted source=cursor project=苏住房G\\\\n- 推论：凡是只读派生字段（合计、面积、里程、比例）都由 watch 驱动，勿依赖交互事件\\\\n- 验证：移除面积字段 @change、新增 watch 监听 aboveFloorArea/underFloorArea，同步到 complex、complexChange、complexSearch 三处\\\\n- 涉及文件：zhi2-web-admin/src/views/property/complex/detail.vue、property/complexChange/detail.vue、building/complexSearch/detail.vue\\\\n- 所属项目：苏住房G；来源会话：0c58b1c2-0dda-4b30-a6fc-15ae19f0f03b；代码基线：320507d\"\n188 |     },\n189 |     {\n190 |       \"uri\": \"viking://user/default/memories/preferences/user/无组标题的问卷主题表格组件.md\",\n191 |       \"cooldown_note\": \"never_checked\",\n192 |       \"frontmatter\": {},\n193 |       \"body_sha256_16\": \"6d4d75e6c3d7ae38\",\n194 |       \"content\": \"- 创建了组件 `TopicInfoTable.vue` (在 `detail.vue` 中引用，之前未导入它)；无分组时扁平显示且无标题 \\\\\"默认不分组\\\\\"，有分组时显示分组名称，容器 `padding:0 24px 24px`\\\\n- `TopicDialog.vue` 将基本信息包裹在 `Headline` 块中，样式与题目选项保持一致 (`18px 24px`)\\\\n- 涉及文件: survey/template/detail.vue, TopicTable.vue, TopicDialog.vue, OptionTable.vue, GroupTable.vue, evaluation/surveyRelease/release/components/SurveyTopicInfoTable.vue, subTableMixins.js, Headline/index.vue\\\\n- 验证：源会话 946e7e74-221e-42c1-acb7-c1bf634305ac\\\\n\\\\n## 验证与归属\\\\n- 所属项目：产品2.0\\\\n- 验证证据：extracted source=cursor project=产品2.0\\\\n- 来源会话：946e7e74-221e-42c1-acb7-c1bf634305ac\"\n195 |     },\n196 |     {\n197 |       \"uri\": \"viking://user/default/memories/entities/苏住房c技术/weixin_systeminfo_polyfill.md\",\n198 |       \"c