{"id": "msg_b1205bc225d4477e96548c1904b76591", "role": "user", "parts": [{"type": "tool", "tool_id": "chatcmpl-tool-9b11db3d5b19db13", "tool_name": "ops_inspect_local_file", "tool_uri": "", "skill_uri": "", "tool_status": "completed", "tool_output": "[cwd: resolvedFrom=D:\\repository\\skills; cwdSource=workingDirectory.]\n=== FILE: C:\\Users\\Administrator\\.dsh\\cache\\memory-audit\\dump.txt (Lines 581-810 of 810) ===\n[Notice: revision=c5fd460867bb1d080f03a100931ff1f1c34ead30de4d98b5aa6a027754233056; bytes=54388.]\n581 | - 所属项目：园区物管2.0；代码基线：none\n582 | - 来源会话：e98b3c2b-020e-45a5-bbab-7177966aefbc\n583 | \n584 | ===== 33 | f8e05091cd23c532 | viking://user/default/memories/entities/suzhufang_c_tech/sfb_token_v1_bug.md =====\n585 | # SFB login only stored V2 token missing V1 swap\n586 | SuZhuFang C SFB login logic only saved V2 token without swapping for V1 token, causing apiV1 requests depending on V1 token to fail.\n587 | \n588 | ## Symptoms and Root Cause\n589 | - After SFB login, interfaces requiring V1 token failed\n590 | - App.vue initSfbUser only saved V2 token, did not call getTokenV1() to obtain V1 token\n591 | - userStore.tokenV1 was not written, apiV1 requests lacked authentication\n592 | \n593 | ## Solution\n594 | - Immediately call getTokenV1() after setting V2 token in initSfbUser and write result to userStore.tokenV1\n595 | - Ensure subsequent apiV1 requests carry correct V1 token\n596 | \n597 | ## Verification and Attribution\n598 | - Verification evidence: src=苏住房C/064.md\n599 | - Involved files: src/App.vue, src/store/user.js, src/api/maintenance.js, src/api/security.js, src/pages/redirect/index.vue, src/api/index.js, src/api/v1Instance.js, src/pages/login/index.vue\n600 | - Project: SuZhuFang C; source session: cf09ca87-b417-43c0-b05d-5168f3aa3e55; code baseline: none\n601 | \n602 | ## 验证与归属\n603 | - 所属项目：苏住房C\n604 | - 验证证据：extracted source=cursor project=苏住房C\n605 | - 来源会话：cf09ca87-b417-43c0-b05d-5168f3aa3e55\n606 | \n607 | ===== 34 | c81c3fb69e91fb88 | viking://user/default/memories/entities/技术模式/zs_pagination_migration.md =====\n608 | # zs-pagination v-model 迁移与全局替换\n609 | 产品2.0（zhi2-web-admin）将分页组件从 .sync 语法迁移到 Vue3 v-model 语法，并通过全局正则一次性批量替换。\n610 | \n611 | ## 变更背景\n612 | - zs-pagination 组件已改为 `v-model:current-page` / `v-model:page-size`\n613 | - property/complex/index.vue 已从 `:page.sync` / `:limit.sync` 改为 `v-model:page` / `v-model:limit`，翻页正常\n614 | - 仓库仍有大量其它页面在用 `.sync`，单文件逐个改不现实且易漏\n615 | \n616 | ## 全局替换规则\n617 | - 在 `zhi2-web-admin/src` 目录下用全局正则替换\n618 | - `:page\\\\.sync=\"` → `v-model:page=\"`\n619 | - `:limit\\\\.sync=\"` → `v-model:limit=\"`\n620 | - `<zs-select([^>]*):value\\\\.sync=\"` → `<zs-select$1v-model:value=\"`\n621 | \n622 | ## 验证与归属\n623 | - 验证证据：extracted source=cursor project=2-0\n624 | - 涉及文件：property/complex/index.vue、@zhi2-web-admin/src/components/zs-pagination/zs-pagination.vue\n625 | - 所属项目：2-0（产品2.0）；来源会话：73a5ecd2-f9fb-443b-b4b0-8e8521acce74；代码基线：none\n626 | \n627 | ===== 35 | 789ba43ca5f67d37 | viking://user/default/memories/entities/su_housing_c_tech/app_analytics_token_fix.md =====\n628 | # 埋点请求缺失 token 修复\n629 | 苏住房C小程序 `appAnalytics.js` 埋点请求因 `skipToken: \n\n[...]\n\nedge'（ms-playwright 缓存缺失）；确认弹窗跳转的 URL 是 uni.navigateTo 二次编码，DOM 断言用 .selection-card/.ticket/.filters\n753 | \n754 | ## 提交\n755 | - 2026-11-16 dev 分支 commit fb72f4f\n756 | \n757 | ===== 43 | 103734158aac3138 | viking://user/default/memories/entities/技术模式/scrappedrecord_facility_name.md =====\n758 | # 报废记录设施设备类别列显示修复\n759 | 产品2.0 的 scrappedRecord 列表因接口返回类别名称不在顶层字段或为名数组，导致「设施设备类别」列空白，后通过 formatter 兼容多级路径与数组。\n760 | \n761 | ## 问题根因\n762 | - 列表接口返回的类别名称可能不在顶层 `facilityDefinitionName`，而在 `facilityDefinition`、`facility` 等子对象里\n763 | - 名称也可能是字符串数组（多级路径），表格列只绑了 `prop: 'facilityDefinitionName'`，所以一直为空\n764 | \n765 | ## 修复方案\n766 | - 在 `scrappedRecord/index.vue` 为「设施设备类别」列增加 `formatter`，通过 `resolveFacilityDefinitionName` 按优先级取值并转字符串\n767 | - 取值优先级：顶层 `row.facilityDefinitionName` → `row.facilityDefinition.facilityDefinitionName` → `row.facility.facilityDefinitionName`\n768 | - 若上述任一为字符串数组，则用 ` / ` 拼接展示\n769 | \n770 | ## 涉及文件与归属\n771 | - 涉及文件：`src/views/dataProperty/scrappedRecord/index.vue`、`detail.vue`、`src/mixins/listMixins.js`\n772 | - 所属项目：产品2.0；来源会话：f8b4bd31-2a17-4162-a6aa-7b14123bf0f6；代码基线：none\n773 | \n774 | ## 验证与归属\n775 | - 验证证据：extracted source=cursor project=产品2.0\n776 | \n777 | ===== 44 | f0eb388c6e6dafe0 | viking://user/default/memories/entities/园区公共收益技术/zs_table_fix.md =====\n778 | # zs-table 单元格空值修复\n779 | zs-table.vue 的单元格鼠标移入/移出处理函数增加空值判断，修复 [Vue warn] 报错。\n780 | \n781 | ## 问题原因\n782 | - 报错来自 zs-table.vue 的 cell-mouse-enter / cell-mouse-leave 处理函数\n783 | - 部分场景（合计行、固定列边缘、表格重绘瞬间）Element UI 传入的 cell 为 undefined\n784 | - 直接访问 cell.parentElement 触发 [Vue warn]: Error in v-on 错误\n785 | \n786 | ## 修复内容\n787 | - 在 handleCellMouseEnter / handleCellMouseLeave 中增加空值判断\n788 | - 仅在 cell?.parentElement 存在时才添加/移除 hover-row 类\n789 | - 属于全局组件修复，所有使用 zs-table 的列表页（如房屋列表页）均受益\n790 | \n791 | ## 验证与归属\n792 | - 验证证据：extracted source=cursor project=园区公共收益\n793 | - 涉及文件：src/components/zs-table/zs-table.vue、src/views/building/house/index.vue\n794 | - 所属项目：园区公共收益；来源会话：65ff3dc2-6a51-41e1-8dfa-f8e3a9d71203\n795 | \n796 | ===== 45 | 0dffc7e785c3e999 | viking://user/default/memories/entities/技术模式/region_button_fix.md =====\n797 | # 区域银行授权删除按钮缺失修复（苏住房G）\n798 | 苏住房G 项目修复系统管理区域银行授权区级节点操作列缺少删除（及编辑）按钮的问题。\n799 | \n800 | ## 问题原因\n801 | - 区级 `district` 的 `buttons` 原只配了「查看」和「变更」，已写好的 `handleDeleteVersion`、`handleUpdate` 方法未挂到 `buttons`，页面不显示按钮\n802 | \n803 | ## 修复内容\n804 | - 区级操作列补回编辑、删除按钮：显示条件为有待提交版本（`pendingVersionId`）或草稿状态（`bizState === '0'`）；变更按钮条件为已备案（`bizState === '2'`）且无待提交版本\n805 | - 修正 `handleDeleteVersion` 确认框参数错误：原用 `content`，`confirm` 方法实际认 `message`，导致提示文案不对\n806 | \n807 | ## 验证与归属\n808 | - 所属项目：苏住房G；来源会话：38650b90-e3ca-4bec-979e-fbc872878820；验证证据：extracted source=cursor project=苏住房G\n809 | - 涉及文件：`system/regionBankAuth/index.vue`、`listMixins.js`\n810 | \n[Notice: 230 items displayed; comple